cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'To cite package "onepagr" in publications use:'
type: software
license: MIT
title: 'onepagr: Accessible One-Page Reports from Typst Templates'
version: 0.1.0
abstract: Generates polished, WCAG 2.2 AA and PDF/UA-1 accessible one-page (front-and-back)
  PDF reports from analysis output, using a small set of fixed Typst report templates
  and a swappable design-token theme system. Ships built-in report templates and themes,
  and lets a consuming project supply its own design tokens and Typst templates.
